OL,3,GNEWSAFriends, 12, win award for
OL,4,A250-mile charity ride
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo 12-year-old friends have won a
OL,7,Fnational award for their fundraising
OL,8,Fafter a 250-mile cycle ride to France.
OL,10,FIris and Esmae, from Rugby, set out on
OL,11,Fthe London-to-Paris bike ride to raise
OL,12,Fmoney for the charity Sense, which
OL,13,Fsupports Iris' sister Mia, with mum
OL,14,FIris heading up a support team for
OL,15,Fthem.
OL,17,FMia, 19, was born with a rare genetic
OL,18,Fcondition that left her blind and with
OL,19,Fcerebral palsy.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
