OL,3,GNEWSAFriends, 12, win award for
OL,4,A250-mile charity ride
OL,5,
OL,6,FDuring the 10-day ride, the pair raised
OL,7,Fclose to #18,000 and have now been
OL,8,Fjointly named Fundraiser of the Year at
OL,9,Fthe Sense Awards 2026.
